{"ID":"20240513083204-mo2kjh3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083204-mo2kjh3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083204-mo2kjh3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513143009-ywetuy8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150426-g05wurt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4552,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150426-g05wurt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:240,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:240\u0026#125;","title":"173","type":"doc","updated":"20240515122627"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513143009-ywetuy8","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 957px;","id":"20240513143009-ywetuy8","updated":"20240515122627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2005/05/24"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"153 A, B"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"49歲, 約旦人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2005/05/24"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淋巴癌移轉腦瘤, 自述近三個月來體力很差,精神不振,時常白日昏睡,直到三週前突然無法言語,人失去平衡,到醫院去檢查,才得知有腦瘤跟淋巴癌,但是西醫無法確知是淋巴癌移轉腦瘤還是腦瘤移轉淋巴癌. 二週前做放射線治療, 之後語言恢復正常. 仍有6次放射線治療要做.(摘錄自5/24/2005診療日誌)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡眠 : 不好, 每日4am醒來."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 胃口 : 好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 大便 : 每日都有."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 口渴 : 有, 喜熱飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 身體溫度 : 身無寒熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 其他體症 : 雙腿失去力量, 且雙腳麻. 口中苦, 喜甜食"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 小便淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脈洪虛數中空"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白濕, 有牙痕."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 腎陽反應不足, 肺區出現肺癌白點塊"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→病由肺來"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脊柱按壓 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 所有督脈都沒有壓痛點"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 腎陽不足, 肺區白點多 (病由肺來)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子四錢  桂枝三錢  (強心火)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢  玉金五錢  龍膽草三錢  川芎三錢  丹皮三錢 (清肝解毒)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"熟地三錢  陽起石五錢 (補腎)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫磺三錢(布包)  防己三錢  (通利三焦)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓦楞子五錢  牡蠣一兩  (散結)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏三錢  桔梗五錢 (去痰飲)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六付 9碗"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3碗 早晚餐前服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"此人按照中醫診斷是恐傷腎,因而"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"腎寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":",導致肺中白色營養無法進入腎臟而逆流入腦,逆流入三焦所致,肺為腎之母,這本屬於腎的營養, 現在卻逆流到不該的地方,因而陰積, 陽氣不行,於是生出腫瘤. 更且由於病因在腎,腎屬水主冬季,而現在是夏季屬火,所以就在這相剋的季節發病了,治這類病的思考模式必須先強心,心主火,導引心火下行到小腸,使腎臟寒水退去,水火不剋,再通利三焦,如此肺中營養自然下行入腎,這才是真正解決這病因所在的方式,才可以做到讓同樣的病不再復發.(摘錄自5/24/2005診療日誌)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240513150317-qbxkgtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513150317-qbxkgtm"}},{"ID":"20240513150318-63db7yc","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 913px;","id":"20240513150318-63db7yc","updated":"20240513150318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2005/05/24"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Basam Ahmed"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"49歲, 約旦人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2005/06/01"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腦瘤與淋巴癌. 已作13次放射線治療, 還有4次要作."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 不好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 每日都有."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"身體溫度 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 額溫 (表示腫瘤變小, 但津液過多在腦中. Ps: 此處缺少與上次額手溫度的比較, 然而依倪師文意, 應是患者有陰陽趨向平衡的意思. "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其他體症 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 頭痛. 下半身無知覺. 性功能喪失. 時常失去平衡."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其他：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白濕, 牙痕重."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"眼白血絲多 (易發作癲癇)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷： 腦中仍有積濕"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同5月24日方加 : "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"南星三錢, 地龍二錢(另包) "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗→3碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240513150330-p554r86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513150330-p554r86"}},{"ID":"20240513150332-c3t4lr6","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns